# Extra droiddeck-esync packs shipped in the APK next to the signed bundle (release.env).
# They are not in the signed index; the APK is their trust root. fetch-extra.sh verifies every
# asset against the sha256 below and writes app/src/main/assets/droiddeck-esync-extra/.
# Each pack needs both <id>.tzst and <id>.json (the index entry built with it).
# repo	tag	asset	sha256
